{
  "subtitle": "Second numbers to keep your real one private.",
  "subsections": [
    {
      "id": "phone-numbers",
      "title": "Second Phone Numbers & SMS",
      "summary": "Keep your real number private.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p>Your phone number is often the key to your identity: it links accounts together and can be used to reset them. A second number keeps your real one off sign-up forms and marketplaces.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "label": "Careful",
          "html": "<p>Free “receive SMS online” sites are <b>public</b> &mdash; anyone can read the codes &mdash; and their numbers are shared and recycled. Never use them for an account you want to keep, and never for banking or two-factor codes.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "subheading",
          "style": "label",
          "text": "Numbers you keep"
        },
